{"read_id": "READ-20261026-4858c1", "session_id": "SESSION-20261026-948744", "target": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261025-b05e3d"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "線を引く前後の境界を、見えない星を星図で代替しない選択として描いた。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
